{"id":"676fecd09411613c","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-set-theory-syntax.md","title":"集合论语言、受限量词与 Δ₀ 公式","display":"df-set-theory-syntax — 集合论语言、受限量词与 Δ₀ 公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-set-theory-syntax","aliases":["72-df-set-theory-syntax"],"display":"df-set-theory-syntax — 集合论语言、受限量词与 Δ₀ 公式","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.2, print215–216/PDF227–228","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source language and bounded grammar; concrete structure typing checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-set-theory-syntax"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-set-theory-syntax</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-set-theory-syntax — 集合论语言、受限量词与 Δ₀ 公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.2, print215–216/PDF227–228"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source language and bounded grammar; concrete structure typing checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 的五分量签名与扩充自由公式树；取与全部构造标签及变量不同的二元关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E\">\\(\\mathsf E\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset_f\">\\(\\emptyset_f\\)</span> 表示空函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x,y,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal F_\\in\\)</span> 为纯集合公式集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\in\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\in\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{av}_s\">\\(\\operatorname{av}_s\\)</span> 为全部出现变量集。受限量词宏只在 x≠y 时使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 遍历集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\in\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\in\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\models_sT\">\\(M\\models_sT\\)</span> 对全部集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_\\in(M)\">\\(\\mathfrak M_\\in(M)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a> 的四元结构格式，其结构求值以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\eta\\models_s A\">\\(M,\\eta\\models_s A\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(M\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\">\\(\\eta\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\)</span> 下调用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_\\in:=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\emptyset_f,\\{\\mathsf E\\},\\{\\langle\\mathsf E,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathcal F_\\in:=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma_\\in),\\qquad x\\in_s y:=\\mathsf E(\\langle x,y\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_\\in:=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\emptyset_f,\\{\\mathsf E\\},\\{\\langle\\mathsf E,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathcal F_\\in:=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma_\\in),\\qquad x\\in_s y:=\\mathsf E(\\langle x,y\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\forall x\\in_s y)A&amp;:=\\forall x(x\\in_s y\\to A),\\qquad\n(\\exists x\\in_s y)A:=\\exists x(x\\in_s y\\land A),\\\\\nD_0&amp;:=\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)\\cup\\{\\top,\\bot\\},\\\\\nD_{n+1}&amp;:=D_n\\cup\\{\\neg A:A\\in D_n\\}\\cup\\{A\\circ B:A,B\\in D_n\\}\n\\cup\\{(Qx\\in_s y)A:A\\in D_n,x\\ne y\\},\\\\\n\\Delta^s_0&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D_n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{av}_s(x\\doteq y)&amp;:=\\{x,y\\},\\quad\\operatorname{av}_s(x\\in_s y):=\\{x,y\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{av}_s(\\top):=\\operatorname{av}_s(\\bot):=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{av}_s(\\neg A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{av}_s(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{av}_s(A\\circ B):=\\operatorname{av}_s(A)\\cup\\operatorname{av}_s(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{av}_s(QxA):=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{av}_s(A),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M_\\in(M)&amp;:=\\langle M,\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\n\\{\\langle\\mathsf E,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in M^2:a\\in b\\}\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\\\\nM,\\eta\\models_s A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M_\\in(M),\\eta}(A)=1,\\\\\nM\\models_s T&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow M\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall A\\in T\\ \\forall\\eta\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\ (M,\\eta\\models_s A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\forall x\\in_s y)A&amp;:=\\forall x(x\\in_s y\\to A),\\qquad\n(\\exists x\\in_s y)A:=\\exists x(x\\in_s y\\land A),\\\\\nD_0&amp;:=\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)\\cup\\{\\top,\\bot\\},\\\\\nD_{n+1}&amp;:=D_n\\cup\\{\\neg A:A\\in D_n\\}\\cup\\{A\\circ B:A,B\\in D_n\\}\n\\cup\\{(Qx\\in_s y)A:A\\in D_n,x\\ne y\\},\\\\\n\\Delta^s_0&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D_n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{av}_s(x\\doteq y)&amp;:=\\{x,y\\},\\quad\\operatorname{av}_s(x\\in_s y):=\\{x,y\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{av}_s(\\top):=\\operatorname{av}_s(\\bot):=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{av}_s(\\neg A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{av}_s(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{av}_s(A\\circ B):=\\operatorname{av}_s(A)\\cup\\operatorname{av}_s(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{av}_s(QxA):=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{av}_s(A),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M_\\in(M)&amp;:=\\langle M,\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\n\\{\\langle\\mathsf E,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in M^2:a\\in b\\}\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\\\\nM,\\eta\\models_s A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M_\\in(M),\\eta}(A)=1,\\\\\nM\\models_s T&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow M\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall A\\in T\\ \\forall\\eta\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\ (M,\\eta\\models_s A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>纯语言无常元、无函数，因此项恰为变量。受限量词不是新的对象构造子；Δ₀ 是按已声明宏生成的语法子集，而不是任意与有界公式语义等价的公式集。结构中的成员关系始终是实际 ∈ 的限制，不将任意二元关系误当作传递集模型。对空域不调用通常的一阶满足递归，模型资格显示排除空集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 的五分量签名与扩充自由公式树；取与全部构造标签及变量不同的二元关系符号 $\\mathsf E$。$\\emptyset_f$ 表示空函数。$x,y,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S$，$\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"下式的 $\\mathcal F_\\in$ 为纯集合公式集，$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\in$；$\\operatorname{av}_s$ 为全部出现变量集。受限量词宏只在 x≠y 时使用。$M$ 遍历集合，$T\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\in$；$M\\models_sT$ 对全部集合 $M$ 定义。$\\mathfrak M_\\in(M)$ 取 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]] 的四元结构格式，其结构求值以及 $M,\\eta\\models_s A$ 只在 $M\\ne\\varnothing$、$\\eta\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}$ 下调用。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf E","display":false},{"tex":"\\emptyset_f","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{av}_s","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"M\\models_sT","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_\\in(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M,\\eta\\models_s A","display":false},{"tex":"M\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_\\in:=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\emptyset_f,\\{\\mathsf E\\},\\{\\langle\\mathsf E,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathcal F_\\in:=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma_\\in),\\qquad x\\in_s y:=\\mathsf E(\\langle x,y\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\forall x\\in_s y)A&:=\\forall x(x\\in_s y\\to A),\\qquad\n(\\exists x\\in_s y)A:=\\exists x(x\\in_s y\\land A),\\\\\nD_0&:=\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)\\cup\\{\\top,\\bot\\},\\\\\nD_{n+1}&:=D_n\\cup\\{\\neg A:A\\in D_n\\}\\cup\\{A\\circ B:A,B\\in D_n\\}\n\\cup\\{(Qx\\in_s y)A:A\\in D_n,x\\ne y\\},\\\\\n\\Delta^s_0&:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D_n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{av}_s(x\\doteq y)&:=\\{x,y\\},\\quad\\operatorname{av}_s(x\\in_s y):=\\{x,y\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{av}_s(\\top):=\\operatorname{av}_s(\\bot):=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{av}_s(\\neg A)&:=\\operatorname{av}_s(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{av}_s(A\\circ B):=\\operatorname{av}_s(A)\\cup\\operatorname{av}_s(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{av}_s(QxA):=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{av}_s(A),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M_\\in(M)&:=\\langle M,\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\n\\{\\langle\\mathsf E,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in M^2:a\\in b\\}\\rangle\\}\\rangle,\\\\\nM,\\eta\\models_s A&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M_\\in(M),\\eta}(A)=1,\\\\\nM\\models_s T&:\\Longleftrightarrow M\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall A\\in T\\ \\forall\\eta\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\ (M,\\eta\\models_s A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3264,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"a817d4e9e855b803","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] 的纯集合公式、实际成员结构及变量 $v_i$。$\\operatorname{Def}_s$ 是集合上的可定义类运算，$\\alpha,\\lambda$ 为序数。$L_\\alpha$ 是由任意集合长的超限递归片段一致确定的类函数值，未将全体序数当作集合函数的定义域。"},{"id":"155f29c77793ff50","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_\\in,\\Delta^s_0,\\operatorname{av}_s$、部分自由代入取 [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]]；$\\leftrightarrow$ 缩写 $(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)$。$\\operatorname{ucl}_s(A)$ 按其有限自由变量指标递增作全称闭包。"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"89b10fd8e1240dc5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\in$，$z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\operatorname{av}_s(A)$；语法与受限量词取 [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]]。所有递归子式沿用同一个 z，$P$ 遍历原子及 $\\top,\\bot$。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-511","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"96c925b05567b126","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varnothing\\ne M\\subseteq N$ 均为传递集合，即 $\\forall a\\in M\\ (a\\subseteq M)$、$\\forall a\\in N\\ (a\\subseteq N)$。$A\\in\\Delta^s_0$，$\\gamma\\in M^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}$，$\\eta\\in N^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}$ 在 $\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)$ 上相同；语法语义取 [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]]。"}],"outgoing":["3c073b947b255638","5c014dab66d624c8"]}